WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.680
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.430
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.350
So far on Aikatsu!

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:16.060
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo, a third-year at an idol school called Starlight Academy.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.490
We use Aikatsu cards to do our activities.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.830
Otoshiro Seira from Dream Academy, or DreAca for short,

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.970
along with her producer, Saegusa Kii-chan, just made their idol debuts.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.250
Aikatsu is getting more and more passionate.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.360
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.560
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.760
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.380
Ai... katsu! Ai... katsu!

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.460
Ai... katsu! Ai... katsu!

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.520
Otome-sama, I notice you have a mascot character phone strap.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.020
Aye! He's from the land of fairies!

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.650
He's Potepo the mascot character! {I want to use something other than "mascot character", but eruuuuuuugh}

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.570
Sakura-tan, yours is super cute too!

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:57.450
Yes.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:02.660
He is... Akkumadori-kun!

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:05.960
Oh.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.290
I don't get what you like so much about mascot characters.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:10.300
Yurika-sama!

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.420
Yurika-sama, not interested in mascot characters?

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.550
Horror characters, maybe.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:19.550
Mascot characters aren't really my style.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:22.450
Isn't that a mascot character too?!

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.250
I won't allow such remarks.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.340
Hey, Aoi.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.400
What?

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.330
What are these "musket characters" everyone's talking about? {I wonder if this is what Yukiho feels like without her shovel}

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.070
It's not "musket". They're mascots.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.430
Mascot characters?

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:40.490
Ran, you're... not interested in mascot characters, are you?

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.580
Mascot characters?

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.930
Well... it depends.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.080
Ran-tan is the Beautiful Blade!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.030
Mascot characters don't suit her at all!

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.070
She's right.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.590
Your image would fall apart.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:56.970
R-Really?

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:38.530
So they were mascot characters, not musket characters.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:46.370
Right. They're called that because they have mascot-like designs and because they're characters. {kill me}

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.290
It's no surprise you didn't hear about them while in America.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.400
This one...

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:59.650
This one won the award for "Mascottiest Mascot" in last year's vote. It's called Ebipon.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:04.510
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say that he
 triggered the mascot character boom of today.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.250
Ran had one of these on her Aikatsu phone.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.430
What did you just say?! {That's not something I can just unhear!}

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.560
What's going on?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.530
Ah, Ran. Actually...

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.610
Sorry.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.070
Yes, this is Shibuki.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.470
Ah, Anna-san! Good morning!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.290
Yes.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.200
I'll go right away.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.310
I can't see it.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:30.330
Anna-san's Spicy Ageha's top designer, right?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:33.830
Yeah, she said her new Constellation Premium Dress was done.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.250
I'm gonna go see it now.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.230
Good for you.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.130
Go for it!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.090
Thanks!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.720
I really wanted to ask about Ebipon.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.300
I was waiting for you, Ran.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.430
As you know, the trend this year is Constellations.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:55.670
This will be the very first Constellation Premium Dress Spicy Ageha puts out.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.440
So this...

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.190
Yes.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:08.950
This is the new Premium Dress, the King Leo Coord.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.740
Wow...

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.830
Drawing inspiration from the constellation Leo,

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.830
I've incorporated a crown to represent the lion, the king of the beasts, {this is a touch too long, but eh}

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.340
and feathers from wild birds to represent the savannah he rules over.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:23.960
This dress displays both the might and the splendor of a king.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:28.350
It's a dress made only possible by the inspiration you gave me.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:31.290
I've never seen a dress this awesome.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:31.890
I love it!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.490
Thank you.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.730
I would like you to wear this dress at your next fashion show and perform a Constellation Appeal with it.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.670
Only by wearing one of the new Constellation Dresses

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:50.560
and by maximizing the audience's voltage meter can this Special Appeal be performed.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:53.500
That's the Constellation Appeal.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.370
Ran, I'm sure you can do it.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.720
You're my muse, after all.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:16.230
It's a difficult dress to wear well, but I'm counting on you, Ran.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:17.540
Okay!

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:25.860
I hear Shibuki has gotten her hands on a Constellation Premium Dress.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.760
Wonderful!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.860
You've done it, Academy Mother!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:32.350
It's too early to celebrate.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:36.860
Shibuki still has to perform the Constellation Appeal at her next fashion show.

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.660
No problem!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:45.630
Have you forgotten how hard Shibuki worked to become Spicy Ageha's representative model?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.130
Of course I haven't.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.520
A model's job is to dazzle with her appearances.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:55.340
However, a model must also endure the shine of bright lights for extended periods of time,

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:01.150
as well as having to wear winter clothes in the middle of summer to time the advertisements right.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:05.560
Shibuki has prevailed through every challenge with a smile.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:10.580
And now, she's become the muse of a brand.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.660
I have complete faith in her.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.930
Let's just believe in her.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:23.170
<i>On that day, I was chosen to be Spicy Ageha's representative model.</i>

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.700
Let's bring fire to the Spicy Ageha brand together. {I know it's not moeru, whatever}

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.570
Yes!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:34.890
<i>However, whether I can pull this Constellation Appeal off is up to my own abilities.</i>

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.880
<i>I don't want to let Anna-san down.</i>

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.770
<i>I want to live up to my fans' expectations.</i>

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:47.070
<i>I will wear this Constellation Dress well and perform a Constellation Appeal!</i>

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.700
Ran's home!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.200
Girls, is everything ready for Ran's party? {"party" tsukatte mo ii desu ka}{I don't like every/every. also yes}

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:58.000
Otome-chan and company set up a whole table of sweets! {I wanted to use smorgasbord, but that's a sandwich}

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.170
PowaPuri's been doing constant research on sweets!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.870
While keeping the current snacking trends in mind,

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:11.220
I asked my grandmother for things like rice crackers, salted kelp, and dried plum that would suit Ran's palate,

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.720
and had it all delivered!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.980
Great.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:20.600
Now, as an idol professor, I'm going to investigate whether Ran really does like Ebipon.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.950
I feel like Ran would tell you if you'd just ask.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.270
Yeah, probably.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.650
But I'd be so shocked if she actually <i>did</i> like Ebipon!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.770
I'm scared to ask!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:34.110
I don't not understand how you feel.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:40.370
That also means that we wouldn't not have to ask her the question really, really subtly.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.790
I see.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.880
Yurika-sama is also deeply curious about Ran and Ebipon.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.420
She's here!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.310
Welcome back!

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.380
I'm home...

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.630
Wait, what's with all this?

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:56.980
We were waiting for you so we could all celebrate together.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.230
Celebrate?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.820
You got a Constellation Dress, right?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.970
So that's why.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.550
They're so cool!

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:08.250
They're so Love You!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:08.900
Yeah.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.250
What you've got here is pretty amazing too.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.400
Eat to your heart's content!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.870
Thanks.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.410
I think it's too early to celebrate, though.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:21.130
I don't want to relax until the fashion show is over.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.130
Understood.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.830
Well, more like I always understand.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.160
Have some salted kelp.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:27.170
Thank you.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.450
By the way, where's your Aikatsu phone?

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.870
I dropped it off in my room.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.130
Why?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.130
No reason.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:38.680
Good luck, Ran!

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.670
We're all cheering you on.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.410
Thanks.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.200
See ya.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.330
Do your best!

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:48.300
We never got to ask her about the mascot character.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.820
I want to know so badly!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:57.220
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.750
<i>I have to perform the best Constellation Appeal.</i>

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:03.340
<i>Otherwise, I'll have failed as Spicy Ageha's muse.</i>

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.430
Wait, that's my...

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.300
...my Constellation Dress!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.670
Everything's fine. The cards are right here.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.390
<i>This is bad. I have to get to sleep.</i>

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:44.520
<i>I'll be too tired for tomorrow's lesson.</i>

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.910
<i>I can't sleep! {this song is great}</i>

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:55.250
I still can't imagine Ran liking Ebipon.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.350
Maybe I just saw it wrong.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.550
Looking at you always calms me down,

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.820
Ebipon.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.800
I wonder if Ran's still asleep.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:28.240
I heard she was supposed to be at a fashion show pre-event thing this morning.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:30.550
Then it'd be really bad if she overslept!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.820
Ran, good morning.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:38.410
We brought some garlic-laced special juice! {I don't know if you can use "laced" like that, but it made me laugh so ok-ok-okay}

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.430
She's not in.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.510
Maybe she's out training.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.570
Let's look for her around campus.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.270
Okay.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.310
Aoi?

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:01.650
Ebipon!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:10.830
Wow.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.080
So many Ebipons!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.060
Ran really does like Ebipon.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.070
Unbelievable.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.840
This is too unbelievable!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.840
"I can't believe it!"

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.870
"Seira the cool rock star likes kitties?!"

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:30.350
Let's what the fans' reactions have been...

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.750
Looks like it's ok-ok-okay!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:40.510
The ability to show one's true self while not letting down one's fans is the mark of a true idol!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:44.080
As a producer, I am sat-sat-satisfied.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.240
Enough to puff my chest. {too bad I can't combine "puff my chest" and "pat myself on the back"}

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:47.570
But still,

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.370
Seira really, really likes cats!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:54.530
It's like she'd go off and create a cat kingdom somewhere!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.420
Never never never mind!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.900
Ah, Shibuki-senpai?

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.520
She's so cool!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.520
Did we get here a little early?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:24.300
That's Shibuki Ran.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.050
The way Shibuki-senpai walks is so great!

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.700
Super cool!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:42.780
She's great as usual.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.380
That really surprised me.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.760
The fact that Ran likes Ebipon can never leave our lips.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.850
It completely goes against her image as the Beautiful Blade, after all.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:52.680
Yeah.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.760
Excuse me.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.390
I have a package for Shibuki Ran-san. {why is he asking them, there?}{soleil?}

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.480
Ah, she's not in right now.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.980
It's a valuable package, so I need her to sign for it.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:06.740
She might be in one of the areas next to the school buildings.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.790
Got it. Thanks.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:16.470
Come to think of it, I heard the interview she's doing today will end up in PariColle! {did I skip too many details}{eh}

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:20.870
Wow! That means Ran's one of the very best models there is!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:26.800
Ever since you became Spicy Ageha's representative model,

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:30.440
people have been talking about how much more sexy and powerful its image is. {aurhgieni}

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.510
Thank you.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:36.520
I've always been a big fan of the dresses the top designer, Anna-san, puts out.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.280
Yes.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.930
Morning, Otome-chan.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:47.690
A person making a delivery for Ran-tan just asked me for directions!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:53.530
And the delivery man was holding a giant Ebipon!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.040
Otome was shocked bigtime! {everytime}

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.540
A giant Ebipon?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.040
What's this with Ebipon?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.990
He said it was a campaign present.

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:05.770
Ebipon was <i>super</i> big!

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:09.040
You think it could be for Ran-tan?

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:13.870
Sounds like Ran's package was actually a giant Ebipon. {the batman}

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:18.280
That means the giant Ebipon is on its way to Ran while she's being interviewed?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:18.810
Yeah.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.120
This is bad.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.770
Her image as the Beautiful Blade is on the line!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.310
We have to hurry!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.320
Yeah!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:29.690
The first person to call me "Beautiful Blade"

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.460
was actually my friend. {the shinyuu from that time?}{man, I have no idea. I don't think it was Aoi...}

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.810
It's the perfect phrase to describe a cool beauty like you.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.200
Thank you.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:40.500
The Beautiful Blade and Ebipon just don't match!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.530
Ebipon, wait!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.660
Otome-chan!

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:46.930
Good morning!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:47.710
So about that—

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.090
Where's Ebipon?!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.460
That way...

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:51.580
Thanks!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.220
Maybe this way.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:02.230
I believe it is the duty of the representative model to breathe life and motion into the dress.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.830
There, right there!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.260
Excuse us!

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.240
Good morning!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.450
Johnny-sensei!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.130
Honeys, it'd be terrible if you tripped and fell because you were running so fast.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.470
So bad, you know.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:21.170
It's important for idols to take care of their bodies. Be careful.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.750
Sensei, we're sorry!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.250
What?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.260
Wait!

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:38.260
Thank you for the long interview.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.520
Thanks for interviewing me.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.480
Shibuki-san!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.770
Delivery for you!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.270
Ebipon?!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.830
No!

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.280
We're too late!

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.900
You won the special prize in the Ebipon Present Campaign!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.990
Congratulations!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.820
Thank you so much!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.470
Ran looks so happy.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.050
She really does.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:12.780
Ran,

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:15.190
you really do like Ebipon, don't you?

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:17.930
And it looks like we ran around for nothing.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:22.930
I completely forgot I signed up for this contest half a year ago.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:27.760
With Ichigo in America and DreAca starting up,

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:31.940
I made a vow with everyone else in Starlight to work harder than ever.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:36.180
I was personally aiming to be Spicy Ageha's representative model,

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:39.830
and I was pushing myself to rise higher than I ever had.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:43.410
That's when I found Ebipon.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:48.710
Ebipon's silliness was exactly what I needed at the end of a tiring day,

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.940
and just looking at him made me feel at ease.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.710
You really helped me a lot.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:57.970
I could never get myself to tell anyone that I liked you, though.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:02.470
I thought that it'd be embarrassing for people to know.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.410
Sorry, Ebipon.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.430
I'm sorry!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.510
She started talking to Ebipon.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:10.330
They're in their very own world. {there something, some game which a power called "world for two"... I think it was Maid RPG}

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:13.070
This'll be a treasured photo never to be seen by anyone else.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:14.870
No doubt about it.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:24.450
The playful, Ebipon-loving Shibuki Ran-san will appear in today's Spicy Ageha fashion show.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:28.880
Though she is known as the cool and sexy Beautiful Blade,

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.920
she displayed an outburst of emotion...

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.710
Way to go.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:36.160
The next segment will focus on the ranking...

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.720
I can't believe it. Bad timing!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.100
The fact they're talking about her is proof of her stardom.

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:48.100
Now we'll see if Shibuki's runway skills can make the show a success.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:53.110
Ran-san, a word to your fans, please.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.610
Today's Spicy Ageha show is a must-see.

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:00.390
Watch out for the Constellation Dress Shibuki Ran will wear.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.750
Ran'll do great. She'll definitely pull a Constellation Appeal off.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.530
Yeah!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.000
<i>I'll pull this one off for you!</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.230
She did it. The Constellation Appeal. {what are you doing}

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.230
Ran.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.610
Thank you.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.990
Wow, this looks great!

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:50.380
I've awakened to the cuteness of Ebipon as well!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:51.770
Love you!

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:55.750
I asked for another round of sweets to celebrate the show's success!

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:58.750
Ran, you can eat it all if you want.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.740
I don't know about <i>all</i> of it...

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.380
Headmistress Orihime?

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:09.800
An new offer came in specifically asking for you.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:11.300
Really?

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:18.370
They want you to be Ebipon's public relations representative model!

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:21.180
In other words, you'll be in a unit with Ebipon!

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:23.820
Alright, I'll do my best!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:01.110
I feel at ease whenever I look at Ebipon.

00:24:01.110 --> 00:24:04.210
The best part about mascot characters is how they make you laugh!

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.650
Yet you can still see the love the creator put into it.

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:07.470
Aye!

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:09.890
Calm down with a mascot character!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.730
I heard we're going to be on stage with Kii-chan and company!

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:17.390
And also also! The dance choreography will be done by Seira and me!

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:19.010
Huh? By us?

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:20.430
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.780
Magical Dancing!

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:25.380
Always passionate, idol activities!
